# filesystem.svc's authority (CAP-002). devmgr maps the boot image into it
# (launch configuration), answers "ramdisk" with the RAM block driver's
# endpoint when the live image is writable, and attaches the ATA, NVMe and
# optical drivers later by offer (Fs_Attachments). Its clients reach it by
# their own endpoints; procmgr and devmgr manage its access profiles.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.filesystem"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [
    (notification "filesystem" Notify_Access.Manage "registration")
    (service "launcher-peer" "ramdisk")
    (service "device-manager" "ready")]
  optional => ["ramdisk"])
